# Agents environment

You are running inside the Wunder **agents devcontainer** for the
`{{projectName}}` project. This container is isolated from the host: all
capabilities are dropped, privilege escalation is disabled, and there is no
Docker socket. `sudo` will not work.

- Project root (and your working directory): `{{workspaceFolder}}`
- Node.js: `{{nodeVersion}}`
- Package manager: `{{packageManager}}` (detected from `{{packageManagerSource}}`)

The project source is mounted directly into this container, so you run build,
test and lint commands with your own shell — there is no separate application
container and no SSH hop. See the `node-project` skill for the details.

